    <string name="roguelike_relic_fireball_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage, then [[state_burn|burns]] the target for %3$d turns (%19$d%% of the hit each turn). Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_ice_shard_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage and can [[state_frozen|freeze]] the target: it slows down sharply for %18$s turns, and its blows are numbed (weaker). It sometimes resists — high INT and a good swipe make that rarer. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_lightning_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage and [[state_paralyzed|paralyzes]] the target for %3$d turns: each of its attacks can fall flat (magic still gets through). High INT and a good swipe make that more likely. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_venom_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage and adds a dose of [[state_poison|poison]] (%17$d at most): each dose eats %5$s HP per turn for %3$d turns. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <!-- Le grimoire : reliques du 18/09/2026 (voir DONJON.md, « Le grimoire ») -->
    <string name="roguelike_relic_sunder">Sunder</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_war_cry">War Cry</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_earthquake">Earthquake</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_hunters_mark">Hunter\'s Mark</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_poisoned_blades">Poisoned Blades</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_freezing_rain">Freezing Rain</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_chain_lightning">Chain Lightning</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_sunder_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage (no element) and [[state_fractured|fractures]] the target for %3$d turns: it takes %9$d%% more damage from everything. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_war_cry_desc">[[state_weakened|Weakens]] every enemy for %3$d turns (their blows hit %10$d%% softer), and your next %16$d weapon attacks deal +%7$d%%. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_earthquake_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage (no element) to every enemy, and they stagger: their next turn comes later. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_hunters_mark_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage (no element) and [[state_marked|marks]] the target until it dies: your critical hits strike it harder, and your Deadly Strike finds its opening. When it dies, the mark jumps to another enemy. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_poisoned_blades_desc">Coats your weapon: each of your next %3$d weapon hits adds a dose of [[state_poison|poison]] (%17$d at most), eating %5$s HP per turn. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_freezing_rain_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage to every enemy and [[state_soaked|soaks]] them for %3$d turns: they resist control less, and water reacts with other elements. It puts out fires. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_chain_lightning_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage to the target, then leaps to every other enemy, losing %11$d%% at each leap. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>

