    <string name="roguelike_relic_rend_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage (no element) and opens a [[state_bleeding|wound]] for %3$d turns: the target loses %8$s HP every time it attacks. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_whirlwind_desc">A weapon strike on every enemy: %1$s–%2$s damage each (no element). Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_fan_of_knives_desc">Throws daggers at every enemy: %1$s–%2$s damage each (no element). A critical dagger opens a wound (%8$s HP each time the target attacks). Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_smoke_bomb_desc">[[state_blinded|Blinds]] every enemy for %3$d turns (they attack with disadvantage), and your next weapon attack is a sneak attack: a guaranteed critical. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_acid_flask_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage, adds a dose of [[state_poison|poison]] (%5$s HP per turn) and [[state_fractured|fractures]] the target for %3$d turns: it takes %9$d%% more damage from everything. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_crystallize_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s damage — %12$d times as much to a [[state_frozen|frozen]] target, whose ice then shatters. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_meteor_desc">Calls a meteor that falls %3$d turns later on every enemy: %1$s–%2$s fire damage each. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_magic_missile_desc">%15$d arcane bolts, each on a random enemy, sharing %1$s–%2$s damage. Never resisted. Recharge: %4$d turn.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_arcane_shield_desc">A barrier absorbs the next %8$s damage. If it still holds when your turn comes back, your relics recharge one turn faster. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_holy_light_desc">Deals %1$s–%2$s holy damage and [[state_blinded|blinds]] the target for %3$d turn. The undead fear it. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_regeneration_desc">Heals %8$s HP at each of your next %3$d turns. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_heal_desc">Heals %8$s HP at once (%13$d%% of your max HP). Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_stoneskin_desc">For %3$d turns your armor is multiplied by %14$d, and every blow you take sends %8$s%% back to its author. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_haste_desc">Your speed rises by half for your next %3$d turns: you act more often. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_slow_desc">The target is twice as slow for its next %3$d turns: it acts less often. It sometimes resists. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_hourglass_desc">Turns back time: the next %3$d enemy attacks come more slowly, and your parry window is wider. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_charm_desc">The target\'s next attack hits one of its allies instead (alone, it loses it). It sometimes resists. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>

